music BGM15.mp3
text I'm at the usual corner of the hallway.
text Kotomi isn't here yet.
text I place my bag by my feet and lean against the wall.
text Who should I introduce her to today?
text My mind is buzzing with thoughts.
text The whole building is filled with after-school bustle.
text Students carrying their bags are walking home in a procession.
bgload KURO.jpg 55
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Kotomi is taking a long time to show up.
text I wait another fifteen minutes.
text I hear the chime for a school announcement
sound VY6.aac
text Ichinose-san of Class 3-A. Ichinose-san of Class 3-A. Please come to the teacher's office.
text It's summoning Kotomi.
text Why would they be calling her?
text Is it because she's an honor student, or is it about her truancy? It's hard to tell.
text Either way, it'll be a while before she gets here.
text But if she takes too long, the person I want her to meet might go home.
text While I'm wondering what to do, the chime rings again.
sound VY7.aac
text Ichinose-san of Class 3-A. Ichinose-san of Class 3-A...
text It must be important for the same broadcast to repeat every five minutes.
text Maybe she's somewhere where she can't hear the announcement.
text Or maybe she's already gone home...
text I'm starting to get worried.
text Maybe I shouldn't have forced her to meet new people.
text Or maybe she's had a sudden emergency.
text I don't think Kotomi would break a promise or ignore the school announcement.
choice Go to the teacher's office|Wait a little longer
setvar intF[1089] = selected
sound 02.aac
setvar intF[1089] - 1
if intF[1089] == 0
	goto s10
fi
goto 15
label s10
text I decide to go to the teacher's office.
text I don't want to be nosy, but knowing how stubborn Kotomi is, I have to go.
text She might be frozen in indecision, not knowing which one to prioritize.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Wait, that'd make her a robot...)
text The fact that it's possible is scary.
