text @[Tomoya]
text Excuse me!
text I make a half-hearted greeting and enter the teacher's office.
text The guidance counselor glares at me and turns away rather unsubtly.
text I look around and see the Class A homeroom teacher stand up.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ichinose hasn't come yet?
sound C7M.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text What?
text She looks at me strangely.
text I'm not in any of her classes and have never talked to her before, so I guess it's only natural.
text @[Tomoya]
text Um, I made a promise to meet with her...
sound C7N.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text Meet with her? With Ichinose-san? You?
text You don't have to be so blatant with your surprise.
text @[Tomoya]
text She didn't show up at our meeting place, so I thought she might have come here first. I just wanted to check...
sound C7O.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text Oh? Ichinose-san is meeting with you, huh?
text She sizes me up.
sound C7P.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text You're Okazaki-kun from Class D, right?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, ma'am.
text After answering her, she smiles pointedly.
sound C7Q.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text You're pretty famous, you and Sunohara-kun. In a different way from Ichinose-san, of course.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that so?
text I'm annoyed at being paired with Sunohara, but I just nod obediently for now.
sound C7R.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text If Ichinose-san promised to meet you first and didn't go, she probably isn't at school anymore.
text @[Tomoya]
text How do you know that?
sound C7S.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text A similar thing has happened before. I'm almost positive that's the case this time.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's happened before...?
sound C7T.aac
text @[Class A Homeroom Teacher]
text Well, see you. If you're not in a club, you should go home, too.
text After saying that, she quickly heads to the visitor's room.
